        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.4.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kgs 4.32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The proverbs of Solomon, son of David and king of Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Here are proverbs that will help you to recognize wisdom and good advice, and understand sayings with deep meaning. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They can teach you how to live intelligently and how to be honest, just, and fair. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They can make an inexperienced person clever and teach young people how to be resourceful. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These proverbs can even add to the knowledge of the wise and give guidance to the educated, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "so that they can understand the hidden meanings of proverbs and the problems that the wise raise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOB.28.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Job 28.28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.111.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ps 111.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.9.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Prov 9.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To have knowledge, you must first have reverence for the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1.7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "To",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "…",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "The most important part of knowledge is having reverence for the LORD.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Stupid people have no respect for wisdom and refuse to learn.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pay attention to what your father and mother tell you, my child. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Their teaching will improve your character as a handsome turban or a necklace improves your appearance.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When sinners tempt you, my child, don't give in. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suppose they say, “Come on; let's find someone to kill! Let's attack some innocent people for the fun of it! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They may be alive and well when we find them, but they'll be dead when we're through with them! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "We'll find all kinds of riches and fill our houses with loot! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Come and join us, and we'll all share what we steal.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't go with people like that, my child. Stay away from them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They can't wait to do something bad. They're always ready to kill. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It does no good to spread a net when the bird you want to catch is watching, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but people like that are setting a trap for themselves, a trap in which they will die. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Robbery always claims the life of the robber — this is what happens to",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1.19",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "One ancient translation",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "what happens to",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "the path of.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " anyone who lives by violence.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.8.1+PRO.8.2+PRO.8.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Prov 8.1–3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Listen! Wisdom is calling out in the streets and market places, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "calling loudly at the city gates and wherever people come together:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Foolish people! How long do you want to be foolish? How long will you enjoy pouring scorn on knowledge? Will you never learn? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Listen when I reprimand you; I will give you good advice and share my knowledge with you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have been calling you, inviting you to come, but you would not listen. You paid no attention to me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You have ignored all my advice and have not been willing to let me correct you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So when you get into trouble, I will laugh at you. I will mock you when terror strikes — ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "when it comes on you like a storm, bringing fierce winds of trouble, and you are in pain and misery. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then you will call for wisdom, but I will not answer. You may look for me everywhere, but you will not find me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You have never had any use for knowledge and have always refused to obey the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You have never wanted my advice or paid any attention when I corrected you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So then, you will get what you deserve, and your own actions will make you sick. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inexperienced people die because they reject wisdom. Stupid people are destroyed by their own lack of concern. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But whoever listens to me will have security. He will be safe, with no reason to be afraid.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
